Package: uma
Type: Package
Title: Unity Model Analysis for Temporal Implicit Structures
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Dr. Rebecca D.", "Wooten", 
           email = "rebeccadwooten@gmail.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the Unity Model Analysis (UMA) framework for Temporal 
    Implicit Structures (TIS). Evaluates multivariate system boundaries by 
    regressing a vector of unities against observed fields, interaction terms, 
    and quadratic manifolds, utilizing geometric invariants and the Law of 
    Cosines metric space.
